sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant D as Database
  B->>A: POST /trips
  A->>D: Create trip
  A-->>B: 202 + events URL
  B->>A: Subscribe SSE
  O->>D: Persist events
  O-->>B: Stream stages
  O->>D: Save plan
  B->>A: GET /trips/{id}
  A-->>B: Complete itinerary
